    handle when rc == PLDM_SUCCESS;

Your current code is
```
    rc = co_await dfOpen(terminusManager, tid, &openReq, &openResp);
    if (rc == PLDM_SUCCESS)
    {
    handle when rc == PLDM_SUCCESS;
    }
    else
    {
    log error
    co_return rc;
    }
```
I suggest change to
```
    rc = co_await dfOpen(terminusManager, tid, &openReq, &openResp);
    if (rc != PLDM_SUCCESS)
    {
    log error
    co_return rc;
    }
    handle when rc == PLDM_SUCCESS;
```

Code logic does not change. Just simple and easy to read code.

There much of things done, declare zero set bits & copy that too memcpy and manual size calculation. Why can't it be just 
negoParamsReq.requester_protocol_support[0].byte = 0x81;

